{"data":{"body":"[P2] Preserve terminal exports with supported pre-2.7 cores. Core 2.4\u20132.6 do not provide the new startup `updatedOperations` metadata, so a completion deferred across another suspension eventually arrives here replay-marked with an empty `pending` map. This now drops its only terminal execution span, whereas the previous implementation exported it. Either require core >=2.7 or feature-detect completion notifications and retain legacy behavior when unavailable; add an installed-core deferred-read regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77EX8V","finding_digest":"6202977ae383832f70e3d759ea541def0401a09ed2327e5da8de81a4a98272ae","finding_id":"arf_v1_mibjo6xdqobs64hd25m6uva554","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::executionotelplugin.onoperationend::legacy-core-replay-completion-loss","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::executionotelplugin.onoperationend::legacy-core-replay-completion-loss","line":575,"observation_digest":"a67a374cb60ba1e8b44e990e1da0d328c13b16e23622e9e62b358af1b4d7ecab","observation_id":"aro_v1_uz5dotfwboq6rncotehb3igtfd","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T21:34:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_xj2fn52xpm4xd3basrbqsu3mzj","reviewed_base_sha":"19ee19fa0619093943f079b69943f7b5cdee7ac7","reviewed_head_sha":"172810d6cea37870925e5527770f6e284f7d2847","reviewer":"codex","start_line":575,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":953},"record_id":"art_v1_fz6d6slrarsvcfb5rw56ulans4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T21:34:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
